------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=52 what the ogre saw
Text=We carry the meat out for the giants, the little screaming meat, and we put it at the treeline and we wait like they say. Nothing comes while we stand there. We go behind the rocks in the southeast, where the giant keeps his silver, and then it comes. It is a deer and then it is not a deer. Twice I saw the deer walk on two legs when it thought we had gone. I told the guard-giant. The guard-giant said ogres cannot count.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Where in the southeast, exactly?
Go to node ID=53 where
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=mercury relay
}

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I believe you. Drink your wine.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
