------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=53 where
Text=The dead end past the last wall, where the ground is all trampled and the rocks sit together. The giant Mathuo goes there to drink his silver and thinks nobody knows. That is where it took him, and that is where it will be, because the meat is easy there and the giants do not look.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then that is where I will go.
